<!doctype lake><title>🦨 𝓓𝓮𝓮𝓹𝓢𝓹𝓮𝓮𝓭</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><meta name="autoSpacing" content="1" /><h1 data-lake-id="Tmo73" id="Tmo73" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1fd3543e" id="u1fd3543e">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="u3b86171a" id="u3b86171a"> 𝐙𝐞𝐑𝐎: 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧𝐬 𝐓𝐨𝐰𝐚𝐫𝐝 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐓𝐫𝐢𝐥𝐥𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐏𝐚𝐫𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐭𝐞𝐫 𝐌𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬</span></h1><p data-lake-id="uca17af8a" id="uca17af8a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u899aea8c" id="u899aea8c">基础数据并行不会降低单个设备的内存需求。在当前配备 32GB 显存的 GPU 上，当模型参数量超过 1.4B 时，便会出现显存不足</span></strong></p><ul list="ufe11999f"><li fid="uc57dc13f" data-lake-id="u1bf1e6cc" id="u1bf1e6cc"><span data-lake-id="u1ecc4926" id="u1ecc4926">其他现有方案，例如流水线并行、模型并行和 CPU 卸载等，需要在功能支持、易用性、内存效率以及计算与通信效率之间进行权衡，而这些因素对于实现高速、大规模训练都至关重要</span></li><li fid="uc57dc13f" data-lake-id="u787c1ff5" id="u787c1ff5"><span data-lake-id="ucff58bd4" id="ucff58bd4">在现有的大模型训练方案中，MP 或许是最具潜力的方法。参数量为 11B 的 T5 和参数量为 8.3B 的 Megatron-LM，均借助模型并行实现训练，分别采用 Mesh-TensorFlow 和 Megatron-LM 中的实现</span></li><li fid="uc57dc13f" data-lake-id="uf08b694c" id="uf08b694c"><span data-lake-id="u29ec025c" id="u29ec025c">然而，MP 难以在这些模型规模的基础上继续大幅扩展。MP 沿纵向切分模型，将每一层的计算与参数划分到多个设备上，因此需要在各层的计算过程中进行大量通信。由此，MP 在 GPU 间通信带宽较高的单个节点内能够取得良好效果，但一旦扩展到多个节点，其效率便会迅速下降</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf59fb048" id="uf59fb048"><strong><span data-lake-id="u70218f1a" id="u70218f1a">如何克服现有方案的局限，更高效地训练大规模模型？为回答这一问题，作者首先全面分析现有系统在模型训练过程中的内存消耗，并将其划分为两部分</span></strong></p><ul list="u2c041425"><li fid="u55c15350" data-lake-id="u2a2bb86c" id="u2a2bb86c"><span data-lake-id="u08559682" id="u08559682">对于大规模模型，大部分内存由模型状态占据，包括优化器状态（例如 Adam 中的动量和方差）、梯度以及参数</span></li><li fid="u55c15350" data-lake-id="ue6e52bf1" id="ue6e52bf1"><span data-lake-id="u2e0ae143" id="u2e0ae143">其余内存由激活值、临时缓冲区和无法利用的内存碎片占据，将这些统称为剩余状态</span></li><li fid="u55c15350" data-lake-id="u9b60647a" id="u9b60647a"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua8f8b5da" id="ua8f8b5da" style="color: #DF2A3F">提出零冗余优化器（Zero Redundancy Optimizer，ZeRO），在优化这两部分内存效率的同时，保持较高的计算和通信效率</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua29bc348" id="ua29bc348"><strong><span data-lake-id="u55d57916" id="u55d57916">模型状态的内存优化。模型状态通常占据训练过程中最大比例的内存，但 DP 和 MP 等现有方法均未提供令人满意的解决方案</span></strong></p><ul list="u22975499"><li fid="u2b272ccb" data-lake-id="u096c9ed2" id="u096c9ed2"><span data-lake-id="ub09cc7fd" id="ub09cc7fd">DP 具有较高的计算与通信效率，但内存效率较低；MP 则可能存在计算与通信效率不足的问题。具体而言，DP 在所有数据并行进程中复制完整的模型状态，造成冗余的内存消耗；MP 通过划分这些状态提高内存效率，但通常会使计算粒度过细，并引入高昂的通信开销，从而降低扩展效率</span></li><li fid="u2b272ccb" data-lake-id="uc50ea390" id="uc50ea390"><span data-lake-id="u2ecf0aee" id="u2ecf0aee">这些方法均以静态方式保留整个训练过程所需的全部模型状态，尽管训练过程中并非每个时刻都需要所有状态</span></li><li fid="u2b272ccb" data-lake-id="u6a54bddf" id="u6a54bddf"><span data-lake-id="u3ebfc073" id="u3ebfc073">基于这些观察，提出由 ZeRO 支持的数据并行方法 ZeRO-DP，使其在获得 DP 的计算与通信效率的同时，实现 MP 的内存效率</span></li><li fid="u2b272ccb" data-lake-id="u0d9f69f4" id="u0d9f69f4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6361ceec" id="u6361ceec" style="color: #5C0036">ZeRO-DP 通过对模型状态进行分片，消除数据并行进程之间的冗余状态存储；同时，在训练过程中采用动态通信调度，保留 DP 的计算粒度和通信量，从而维持其计算与通信效率</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u32438ea7" id="u32438ea7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a97f672" id="u9a97f672">ZeRO-DP 包含三个主要优化阶段，分别对应优化器状态、梯度和参数的分片。当这些优化逐步累积启用时</span></strong></p><ul list="u1517c06a"><li fid="uff6c8086" data-lake-id="u0a0ef318" id="u0a0ef318"><strong><span data-lake-id="u505ff09f" id="u505ff09f">优化器状态分片</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bos%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa82a6a9f322b1f25f0e95eb354d502d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iQT4N%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb04101b" id="ufb04101b">​</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7c27a573" id="u7c27a573">：可实现 4 倍的内存压缩，通信量与 DP 相同</span></li><li fid="uff6c8086" data-lake-id="u91140132" id="u91140132"><strong><span data-lake-id="u08e0cd33" id="u08e0cd33">进一步进行梯度分片</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bos%2Bg%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F97eeecda5dc73079b84ff0df0d674b19.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22orNlB%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uea0f8192" id="uea0f8192">​</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue15888a8" id="ue15888a8">：可实现 8 倍的内存压缩，通信量与 DP 相同</span></li><li fid="uff6c8086" data-lake-id="u042e298e" id="u042e298e"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7416b9fa" id="u7416b9fa">进一步进行参数分片</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bos%2Bg%2Bp%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb335a086cae722a1cd4658885a0f4c17.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VlooP%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d6a682e" id="u2d6a682e">​</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u631d0384" id="u631d0384">：内存压缩倍数与数据并行度</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fee6baa3055e916cde82c6b18d3549a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NFSJH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue98ba02d" id="ue98ba02d">呈线性关系，同时通信量增加 50%</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uae304c25" id="uae304c25" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1790904805308-253110a2-58fa-413e-b76e-6cebec8d9da3.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u3461b851-3bac-4cca-8652-c345780ca00%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uaceb4f35-7107-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A793%2C%22height%22%3A348%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A248452%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1449%2C%22originHeight%22%3A635%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22stroke%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22OPTIMIZERSTATES%22%2C%22x%22%3A796%2C%22y%22%3A578%2C%22width%22%3A298%2C%22height%22%3A35%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GRADIENTS%22%2C%22x%22%3A533%2C%22y%22%3A578%2C%22width%22%3A176%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PARAMETERS%22%2C%22x%22%3A235%2C%22y%22%3A581%2C%22width%22%3A212%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(2%2B2%E5%8D%81K*4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1111%2C%22y%22%3A446%2C%22width%22%3A130%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BASELINE%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A152%2C%22width%22%3A140%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CONSUMED%22%2C%22x%22%3A1104%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A157%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MEMORY%22%2C%22x%22%3A1115%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B9%8E-7.5B%22%2C%22x%22%3A1318%2C%22y%22%3A65%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22(2%2B2%2BK*%E4%B9%8E%22%2C%22x%22%3A1073%2C%22y%22%3A166%2C%22width%22%3A215%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPUN-1%22%2C%22x%22%3A888%2C%22y%22%3A87%2C%22width%22%3A115%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GPUO%22%2C%22x%22%3A287%2C%22y%22%3A88%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%E5%B9%B3%E5%8D%812%E5%B9%B3%E5%8D%81%22%2C%22x%22%3A1069%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A34%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2216.6GB%22%2C%22x%22%3A1319%2C%22y%22%3A365%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OS%2BG%2BP%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A490%2C%22width%22%3A99%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22GOU%22%2C%22x%22%3A587%2C%22y%22%3A88%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NG%3D64%22%2C%22x%22%3A1316%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A89%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROS%2BG%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A374%2C%22width%22%3A83%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%2C(2%2BK*4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1130%2C%22y%22%3A352%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.9GB%22%2C%22x%22%3A1323%2C%22y%22%3A458%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.4GB%22%2C%22x%22%3A1321%2C%22y%22%3A258%2C%22width%22%3A79%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22120GB%22%2C%22x%22%3A1317%2C%22y%22%3A168%2C%22width%22%3A88%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222%E4%B9%8E%2B%E5%85%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A1083%2C%22y%22%3A363%2C%22width%22%3A111%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22K-12%22%2C%22x%22%3A1324%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A73%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ND%22%2C%22x%22%3A1153%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A53%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N4%22%2C%22x%22%3A1169%2C%22y%22%3A389%2C%22width%22%3A74%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220S%22%2C%22x%22%3A82%2C%22y%22%3A277%2C%22width%22%3A35%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22NG%22%2C%22x%22%3A1212%2C%22y%22%3A261%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A48%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22989%22%2C%22x%22%3A446%2C%22y%22%3A454%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f5f6ea%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6634c126%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud15f0174" id="ud15f0174"><strong><span data-lake-id="u15419f3d" id="u15419f3d">剩余状态的内存优化：在 ZeRO-DP 提高模型状态的内存效率之后，激活值、临时缓冲区和无法利用的内存碎片所占据的其余内存，可能成为下一个内存瓶颈。为此，提出 ZeRO-R，分别优化这三类因素造成的剩余内存消耗</span></strong></p><ul list="ue3731f30"><li fid="u0f7a067c" data-lake-id="u350056dc" id="u350056dc"><span data-lake-id="u24b58cd3" id="u24b58cd3">对于激活值，即前向传播期间保存、供反向传播使用的中间结果，激活检查点技术虽然有所帮助，但对于大规模模型仍然不够。因此，ZeRO-R 通过激活值分片，识别并消除现有 MP 方法中的激活值冗余副本，从而优化激活值的内存占用。在适当的情况下，它还会将激活值卸载到 CPU</span></li><li fid="u0f7a067c" data-lake-id="u0a13406f" id="u0a13406f"><span data-lake-id="u14013fb6" id="u14013fb6">ZeRO-R 为临时缓冲区设置适当的大小，以平衡内存效率与计算效率</span></li><li fid="u0f7a067c" data-lake-id="uc5fc0570" id="uc5fc0570"><span data-lake-id="ufbfa25da" id="ufbfa25da">不同张量的生命周期存在差异，因此训练过程中会产生内存碎片。内存碎片导致连续内存空间不足，即使仍有足够的空闲内存，也可能发生内存分配失败。ZeRO-R 根据张量生命周期的差异主动管理内存，以防止内存碎片化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud3f0f09d" id="ud3f0f09d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u697d7baa" id="u697d7baa" style="color: rgb(42, 188, 191),rgb(56, 54, 221)">ZeRO-DP 与 ZeRO-R 共同构成一套面向深度学习训练的高效内存优化系统，将其统称为 ZeRO</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="rY4Ow" id="rY4Ow" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u120d6ff9" id="u120d6ff9">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u47d9356c" id="u47d9356c"> 𝐖𝐡𝐞𝐫𝐞 𝐃𝐢𝐝 𝐀𝐥𝐥 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐲 𝐆𝐨?</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub0c5edbd" id="ub0c5edbd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5a81863c" id="u5a81863c" style="color: #AD1A2B">内存究竟消耗在哪里？在模型训练过程中，大部分内存由模型状态占据，即用于存储优化器状态、梯度和参数的张量。除模型状态之外，其余内存由激活值、临时缓冲区和内存碎片占据，将其称为剩余状态</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf759f079" id="uf759f079"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f820112" id="u0f820112">在训练过程中，模型状态占据大部分设备内存。以深度学习训练中最常用的优化器之一 Adam 为例，Adam 需要存储两类优化器状态来计算更新</span></strong></p><ul list="ue9934144"><li fid="ub6641b9f" data-lake-id="u28b762b7" id="u28b762b7"><span data-lake-id="ud33641f6" id="ud33641f6">梯度的时间平均动量；梯度的方差。因此，使用 Adam 训练模型时，必须有足够的内存来保存梯度的动量和方差。此外，还需要足够的内存来存储梯度与权重本身。在这三类与参数相关的张量中，优化器状态通常占据最多的内存，尤其是在采用混合精度训练时</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u14f64061" id="u14f64061"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub974ec33" id="ub974ec33">混合精度训练：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9919c711" id="u9919c711">在当前一代 NVIDIA GPU 上训练大规模模型的先进方法是混合精度（fp16/32）训练。在这种方法中，参数和激活值以 fp16 格式存储，从而能够使用这些 GPU 上具有高吞吐量的 Tensor Core 单元。在混合精度训练期间，前向传播和反向传播均使用 fp16 权重与激活值执行。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud0516b63" id="ud0516b63" style="color: #AE146E">然而，为在反向传播结束后有效地计算并应用参数更新，混合精度优化器会保留一份 fp32 参数副本，以及其他所有优化器状态的 fp32 副本</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u0d0f6ad4" id="u0d0f6ad4"><strong><span data-lake-id="uede51cdc" id="uede51cdc">激活值：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufc839584" id="ufc839584">激活值在训练过程中可能占据大量内存</span></p><ul list="u98292250"><li fid="u35fe4170" data-lake-id="ud7f6971c" id="ud7f6971c"><span data-lake-id="ue497c196" id="ue497c196">例如，对于参数量为 1.5B 的 GPT-2 模型，当序列长度为 1K、批大小为 32 时，激活值约需占用 60GB 内存。激活检查点技术，也称为激活重计算，是一种常用的优化方法：它以增加 33% 的重计算开销为代价，将激活值的内存需求近似降低至原总量的平方根量级</span></li><li fid="u35fe4170" data-lake-id="uc7ad1444" id="uc7ad1444"><span data-lake-id="u27d0fda6" id="u27d0fda6">尽管这种方法能够显著减少内存需求，但对于规模更大的模型，即使采用激活检查点技术，激活值的内存占用仍可能十分庞大</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u678b3550" id="u678b3550"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9937fd65" id="u9937fd65">临时缓冲区：对于大规模模型，用于存储中间结果的临时缓冲区也会占据不可忽略的内存。梯度 all-reduce 或梯度范数计算等操作，为提高吞吐量，通常会先将所有梯度合并到一个展平的缓冲区中，再执行相应操作</span></strong></p><ul list="u8af2f8ea"><li fid="u465850bc" data-lake-id="ue5433ecc" id="ue5433ecc"><span data-lake-id="u45c708e5" id="u45c708e5">例如，跨设备 all-reduce 的有效带宽会随着消息大小的增加而提高。尽管梯度本身通常以 fp16 张量存储，但根据具体操作的要求，合并后的缓冲区可能采用 fp32 张量。当模型规模较大时，这些临时缓冲区的大小不可忽视</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7eddff12" id="u7eddff12"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaa3bd49a" id="uaa3bd49a">内存碎片：此外，即使仍有大量空闲内存，也可能出现可用内存不足的情况，内存碎片化便会导致这一问题。如果没有足够大的连续内存空间来满足分配请求，即使空闲内存总量大于请求大小，内存分配仍然会失败</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="qqjBK" id="qqjBK" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u0d93c246" id="u0d93c246">🌟</span><span data-lake-id="u0302bdba" id="u0302bdba"> 𝐙𝐞𝐑𝐎: 𝐈𝐧𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐎𝐯𝐞𝐫𝐯𝐢𝐞𝐰</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u544f6ea9" id="u544f6ea9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucf3cf327" id="ucf3cf327" style="color: #DF2A3F">ZeRO-DP 在保留 DP 训练效率的同时，实现 MP 的内存效率。ZeRO-DP 对模型状态进行分片，而不是复制完整状态；同时采用动态通信调度，利用模型状态需求随时间变化的特性，并尽量降低通信量。由此，随着数据并行度提高，ZeRO-DP 能够按比例降低模型的单设备内存占用，同时使通信量保持接近标准 DP 的水平，从而维持训练效率</span></strong></p><ul list="u0c7d3eb9"><li fid="ufd10503b" data-lake-id="u42a70364" id="u42a70364"><strong><span data-lake-id="u863c8b24" id="u863c8b24">DP 的扩展效率优于 MP：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6f48ae50" id="u6f48ae50">MP 在减小计算粒度的同时，也增加通信开销。当划分程度超过一定限度时，过细的计算粒度会降低单块 GPU 的执行效率，而增加的通信开销则会限制跨 GPU 的可扩展性，尤其是在跨节点通信时。DP 具有更大的计算粒度和更低的通信量，因此能够实现高得多的效率</span></li><li fid="ufd10503b" data-lake-id="u34013b0f" id="u34013b0f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua00e5777" id="ua00e5777">DP 的内存效率较低：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3fd9d9c7" id="u3fd9d9c7">模型状态被冗余地存储在所有数据并行进程中。MP 通过对模型状态进行分片来提高内存效率</span></li><li fid="ufd10503b" data-lake-id="ucf5ccb86" id="ucf5ccb86"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5daf62e5" id="u5daf62e5">DP 和 MP 都会保留整个训练过程所需的全部模型状态，但并非所有状态在每个时刻都需要使用：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3545d373" id="u3545d373">例如，每一层的参数仅在该层执行前向传播和反向传播时才会被使用</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udfbfa2ab" id="udfbfa2ab"><strong><span data-lake-id="uee50cab6" id="uee50cab6">ZeRO 将激活检查点分片存储在不同 GPU 上，并在需要时通过 all-gather 重建完整的激活检查点，从而消除 MP 中的内存冗余。激活值的内存压缩倍数与模型并行度成正比。对于超大规模模型，ZeRO 甚至可以选择将激活值分片迁移到 CPU 内存中；由于这些模型具有较高的算术强度，这种方式仍然能够保持良好的效率</span></strong></p><ul list="u8f0b0c25"><li fid="ua0050a72" data-lake-id="u60a691c7" id="u60a691c7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u839955b5" id="u839955b5">MP 虽然对模型状态进行分片，但通常仍需要复制激活值。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udd8c49c8" id="udd8c49c8">例如，如果将一个线性层的参数沿纵向切分，并在两块 GPU 上并行计算，那么每块 GPU 都需要完整的激活值，才能计算其负责的参数分片</span></li><li fid="ua0050a72" data-lake-id="ua3c198c3" id="ua3c198c3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua4cbddea" id="ua4cbddea">对于 GPT-2 或规模更大的模型，其算术强度非常高。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uce41386c" id="uce41386c">这里的算术强度是指每次迭代的计算量与该次迭代中激活检查点数据量的比值。该比值很大，并且随隐藏维度呈线性增长。因此，即使通信带宽较低，也能够隐藏激活检查点的数据传输开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue416711f" id="ue416711f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u23f63563" id="u23f63563">ZeRO-R 使用固定大小的缓冲区，避免临时缓冲区随模型规模增长而急剧膨胀，同时确保缓冲区足够大，以维持执行效率</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u66fa7785" id="u66fa7785"><strong><span data-lake-id="u12632af7" id="u12632af7" style="color: #663000">内存碎片化源于短生命周期与长生命周期内存对象的交错分配。在前向传播过程中，激活检查点属于长生命周期对象，而重计算得到的激活值属于短生命周期对象。类似地，在反向传播过程中，激活值梯度的生命周期较短，而参数梯度的生命周期较长。基于这一观察，ZeRO 将激活检查点和梯度迁移到预先分配的连续内存缓冲区中，在运行过程中动态整理内存碎片。这不仅提高内存的可用性，还减少内存分配器查找空闲连续内存所需的时间，从而提高执行效率</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="nRUyB" id="nRUyB" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u12b3c716" id="u12b3c716">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="u0d2bb30c" id="u0d2bb30c" style="color: #663000"> </span><span data-lake-id="u2fc02c81" id="u2fc02c81">𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩 𝐃𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐨 𝐙𝐞𝐑𝐎-𝐃𝐏</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u115eaaa9" id="u115eaaa9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub87587c1" id="ub87587c1">优化器状态分片：对于数据并行度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fee6baa3055e916cde82c6b18d3549a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wDyaL%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u997e1cad" id="u997e1cad">的情况，将优化器状态划分为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fee6baa3055e916cde82c6b18d3549a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J3dwx%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udb706361" id="udb706361">个大小相等的分区，使第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CJTLU%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u593b51be" id="u593b51be">个数据并行进程仅更新第</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2443fbcfeb7e85e1d62b6f5e4f27207e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22abEq7%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u3bc54ff8" id="u3bc54ff8">个分区对应的优化器状态。因此，每个数据并行进程只需存储和更新全部优化器状态的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BN_d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5f318112f1a3dd42e04bbc4d7d1af14f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Aj3F3%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2b4de4fc" id="u2b4de4fc">，并且仅更新全部参数的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BN_d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5f318112f1a3dd42e04bbc4d7d1af14f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22O9zzR%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ubab203f0"><li fid="u00f30c51" data-lake-id="u97750460" id="u97750460"><span data-lake-id="uc41cdc60" id="uc41cdc60">在每个训练步骤结束时，在数据并行进程之间执行一次 all-gather，使所有数据并行进程都获得完整的更新后参数</span></li><li fid="u00f30c51" data-lake-id="uce17bba2" id="uce17bba2"><span data-lake-id="uae29cde0" id="uae29cde0">采用优化器状态分片后，内存消耗从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%224%5C%5CPsi%2BK%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F75df11bb4a14888bdf2a47d41e98248e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eb98R%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue09c00cc" id="ue09c00cc">降低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%224%5C%5CPsi%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7BK%5C%5CPsi%7D%7BN_d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e25132ff152dc875086616f1fad9063.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22t0K3b%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u00f30c51" data-lake-id="u15a9480f" id="u15a9480f"><span data-lake-id="u77454da1" id="u77454da1">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fee6baa3055e916cde82c6b18d3549a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pLCdb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30276d2c" id="u30276d2c">较大时，模型状态的内存需求从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%224%5C%5CPsi%2B12%5C%5CPsi%3D16%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F08369f699336ef54db1a0ff76afe4cbe.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q7Gs8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u679d2b27" id="u679d2b27">字节降低至 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%224%5C%5CPsi%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B12%5C%5CPsi%7D%7BN_d%7D%5C%5Capprox4%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F02fea02ad75a3283ccbe3e9b13fe9671.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OCPYz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uced24a4e" id="uced24a4e">字节，实现约 4 倍的内存压缩</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6a3b7ac8" id="u6a3b7ac8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2a280a5b" id="u2a280a5b">由于每个数据并行进程只更新其对应的参数分区，它只需要这些参数归约后的梯度。在反向传播过程中，当各层的梯度计算完成后，仅将这些梯度归约到负责更新相应参数的数据并行进程。归约完成后，原有梯度便不再需要，其占用的内存可以释放。存储梯度所需的内存便从</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a5d6594e9be2bda82fb9bf1049e6dc2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wpK56%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7709dc15" id="u7709dc15">字节降低至</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B2%5C%5CPsi%7D%7BN_d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1adb94ae8dd57558762e96a5f75d1e32.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EcVA4%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uea6cbb34" id="uea6cbb34">字节</span></strong></p><ul list="u0e885607"><li fid="u594ee6b1" data-lake-id="u535cc0a0" id="u535cc0a0"><span data-lake-id="u5b59bd35" id="u5b59bd35">这一过程实质上是 Reduce-Scatter 操作，即将不同参数对应的梯度归约到不同进程。为提高实际执行效率，采用分桶策略，将属于某个特定分区的全部梯度放入同一个桶中，并对整个桶一次性执行归约。这与 NVIDIA AMP 优化器对梯度 all-reduce 计算进行分桶，以实现通信与计算重叠的思路相似</span></li><li fid="u594ee6b1" data-lake-id="u5c3e729e" id="u5c3e729e"><span data-lake-id="u20a86411" id="u20a86411">针对各个分区执行归约，而不是 all-reduce，从而减少内存占用，并实现计算与通信的重叠</span></li><li fid="u594ee6b1" data-lake-id="uf710de9b" id="uf710de9b"><span data-lake-id="u9fbeba72" id="u9fbeba72">通过同时消除梯度和优化器状态的冗余，将内存占用进一步降低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222%5C%5CPsi%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B14%5C%5CPsi%7D%7BN_d%7D%5C%5Capprox2%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe26f426d9c26f5b4f1a1631576d6f460.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Y01VB%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u594ee6b1" data-lake-id="u6de440c6" id="u6de440c6"><span data-lake-id="u3c161862" id="u3c161862">当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fee6baa3055e916cde82c6b18d3549a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OUGsZ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u951df89b" id="u951df89b">较大时，模型状态的内存需求从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222%5C%5CPsi%2B14%5C%5CPsi%3D16%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F2daf20c62e031d77d9d089c2bef635b4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MAiPu%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u53e9e62c" id="u53e9e62c">字节降低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222%5C%5CPsi%2B%5C%5Cfrac%7B14%5C%5CPsi%7D%7BN_d%7D%5C%5Capprox2%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe26f426d9c26f5b4f1a1631576d6f460.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ny3km%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02880ea7" id="u02880ea7">字节，实现约 8 倍的内存压缩</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2f6df571" id="u2f6df571"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0e16931e" id="u0e16931e">与优化器状态和梯度的处理方式相同，每个进程仅存储其所属分区对应的参数。当执行前向传播或反向传播需要使用本分区之外的参数时，便通过广播从相应的数据并行进程获取这些参数</span></strong></p><ul list="u86ee8c31"><li fid="ua31f4448" data-lake-id="u87b5c3d5" id="u87b5c3d5"><span data-lake-id="udfc6732d" id="udfc6732d">这种方法仅将标准 DP 系统的总通信量增加至原来的 1.5 倍，同时实现与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fee6baa3055e916cde82c6b18d3549a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NREPX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6554cc06" id="u6554cc06">成正比的内存压缩</span></li><li fid="ua31f4448" data-lake-id="uf85f26fe" id="uf85f26fe"><span data-lake-id="udd0db66c" id="udd0db66c">采用参数分片后，对于一个包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb63b49ecb1da3499b85e2108a68d9ca5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sC2gk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u90209768" id="u90209768">个参数的模型，其内存消耗从 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%2216%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc9acd831b493a791cb247de9c72fedc8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jlxGf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf795e9dd" id="uf795e9dd">降低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B16%5C%5CPsi%7D%7BN_d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc4d06843f1c2fc9f301dc6ded4b36900.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TBojn%22%7D"></card></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="GjoN9" id="GjoN9" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ucc634935" id="ucc634935">⚓</span><span data-lake-id="u92b5048b" id="u92b5048b"> 𝐃𝐞𝐞𝐩 𝐃𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐢𝐧𝐭𝐨 𝐙𝐞𝐑𝐎-𝐑</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u8102a38d" id="u8102a38d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9e1e616e" id="u9e1e616e">MP 的设计需要复制激活值，因此在参与模型并行的 GPU 之间产生冗余的激活值副本。ZeRO 通过对激活值进行分片来消除这种冗余，并且仅在激活值即将用于计算之前，逐层恢复其完整副本，每次只恢复一层的激活值</span></strong></p><ul list="u23e8665b"><li fid="ue7d90b8c" data-lake-id="u932bc849" id="u932bc849"><span data-lake-id="u8e7400ae" id="u8e7400ae">具体而言，当模型某一层的前向传播计算完成后，该层的输入激活值被分片存储在所有模型并行进程中，直到反向传播再次需要使用它们。此时，ZeRO 通过一次 all-gather 操作，在各进程上重新恢复完整的激活值副本。将这一优化记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38b0ebcc3cd17845a7fd86182b093d51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u4dXz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u41f5c9a7" id="u41f5c9a7">。它与激活检查点技术配合使用，仅存储分片后的激活检查点，而不保留完整的冗余副本</span></li><li fid="ue7d90b8c" data-lake-id="ub816acf7" id="ub816acf7"><span data-lake-id="u98d08b9a" id="u98d08b9a">当模型规模极大且设备内存十分有限时，还可以将这些分片后的激活检查点卸载到 CPU，使设备端的激活值内存开销降至接近零，但代价是额外的通信开销。并将这种优化记为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Ba%2Bcpu%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F005dab05db23435f08e671219388c3a7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PLVsy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub02f5cb7" id="ub02f5cb7">​</span></li><li fid="ue7d90b8c" data-lake-id="ue1487386" id="ue1487386"><span data-lake-id="u86f15dba" id="u86f15dba">通过分片式激活检查点，ZeRO 能够实现与模型并行度成正比的激活值内存压缩</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8d2c1f94" id="u8d2c1f94"><strong><span data-lake-id="uffeeef12" id="uffeeef12">ZeRO 通过审慎选择临时数据缓冲区的大小，平衡内存效率与计算效率。在训练过程中，某些操作的计算效率高度依赖输入规模，较大的输入通常能够获得更高的效率。例如，大规模 all-reduce 操作能够获得远高于小规模 all-reduce 的有效带宽</span></strong></p><ul list="u98e19e23"><li fid="u518fb86a" data-lake-id="u372ac1c5" id="u372ac1c5"><span data-lake-id="u552562e5" id="u552562e5">为提高执行效率，NVIDIA Apex 或 Megatron 等高性能库会先将所有参数融合到一个缓冲区中，再执行相应操作。然而，融合缓冲区的内存开销与模型规模成正比，可能成为限制因素。例如，对于一个参数量为 3B 的模型，一个采用 32 位精度的融合缓冲区就需要 12GB 内存</span></li><li fid="u518fb86a" data-lake-id="ub11b4fa8" id="ub11b4fa8"><span data-lake-id="u28fbc03b" id="u28fbc03b">为解决这一问题，当模型规模过大时，采用能够保持较高执行效率的固定大小融合缓冲区。这样，缓冲区大小便不再依赖模型规模；同时，只要缓冲区足够大，仍然能够保持良好的执行效率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u69d6186c" id="u69d6186c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ueafd74bd" id="ueafd74bd">模型训练过程中的内存碎片化源于激活检查点机制和梯度计算。在采用激活检查点的前向传播过程中，仅有选定的激活值会被保留供反向传播使用，而大部分激活值会被丢弃，因为它们可以在反向传播时重新计算</span></strong></p><ul list="u6df5038a"><li fid="u4764ae39" data-lake-id="u4de2a689" id="u4de2a689"><span data-lake-id="u456636c1" id="u456636c1">这使短生命周期内存对象，即被丢弃的激活值，与长生命周期内存对象，即作为检查点保留的激活值，交错分布，从而产生内存碎片。类似地，在反向传播过程中，参数梯度属于长生命周期对象，而激活值梯度以及计算参数梯度所需的其他缓冲区属于短生命周期对象。这种短生命周期与长生命周期内存对象的交错分布，同样会导致内存碎片化</span></li><li fid="u4764ae39" data-lake-id="u3ecaa802" id="u3ecaa802"><span data-lake-id="u497a846e" id="u497a846e">在空闲内存充足的情况下，少量内存碎片通常不会造成问题；但在内存受限的大模型训练中，内存碎片化会导致两个问题：即使空闲内存总量充足，也可能因缺少足够大的连续内存空间而发生内存不足；内存分配器需要花费大量时间寻找能够满足分配请求的连续内存空间，导致执行效率下降</span></li><li fid="u4764ae39" data-lake-id="u445f7e70" id="u445f7e70"><span data-lake-id="uf16c3558" id="uf16c3558">ZeRO 为激活检查点和梯度预先分配连续内存块，并在这些数据生成后将其复制到预分配的内存中，从而在运行过程中动态整理内存碎片</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="UFBiZ" id="UFBiZ" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua02b7c20" id="ua02b7c20">⛵</span><span data-lake-id="u2f3ad634" id="u2f3ad634"> 𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐦𝐮𝐧𝐢𝐜𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐀𝐧𝐚𝐥𝐲𝐬𝐢𝐬 𝐨𝐟 𝐙𝐞𝐑𝐎</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u2d58bfe3" id="u2d58bfe3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud36e65bf" id="ud36e65bf">ZeRO 通过消除内存冗余来扩大可训练模型的规模，一个自然的问题是：是否以增加通信量为代价来提高内存效率？换言之，与标准 DP 方法相比，采用 ZeRO 的 DP 方法需要多少通信量？</span></strong></p><ul list="u2186e82a"><li fid="ucd064e4a" data-lake-id="ufc7e62c7" id="ufc7e62c7"><span data-lake-id="u8bba4258" id="u8bba4258">采用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bos%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa82a6a9f322b1f25f0e95eb354d502d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f26Dm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udbab3d73" id="udbab3d73"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_g%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ddba7d9310a62c893f2a61509411e75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GYhZt%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u51b3a1b0" id="u51b3a1b0"> 时，ZeRO-DP 不会引入额外通信，同时能够实现最高 8 倍的内存压缩；</span></li><li fid="ucd064e4a" data-lake-id="u1ecdb2cd" id="u1ecdb2cd"><span data-lake-id="u3e4c9d9f" id="u3e4c9d9f">在 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_%7Bos%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa82a6a9f322b1f25f0e95eb354d502d4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22l41Az%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5fe6f7f0" id="u5fe6f7f0"> 和 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_g%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4ddba7d9310a62c893f2a61509411e75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Aijwp%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8b29e72" id="uc8b29e72"> 的基础上进一步采用 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_p%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6d4a7278092c3f9e0b06bbf4ba2c5c75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LLzxf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04f067b0" id="u04f067b0"> 时，ZeRO-DP 的通信量最高为标准 DP 的 1.5 倍，同时使内存压缩倍数达到 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22N_d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3fee6baa3055e916cde82c6b18d3549a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CsR8A%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf996774c" id="uf996774c">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9c6bede3" id="u9c6bede3"><span data-lake-id="uf4e9dd68" id="uf4e9dd68">在数据并行训练中，反向传播结束之后、计算下一步的参数更新之前，需要对所有数据并行进程中的梯度取平均。这一操作通过 all-reduce 集合通信完成。对于大规模模型，all-reduce 通信完全受通信带宽限制</span></p><ul list="u327c71f2"><li fid="u3f93eee3" data-lake-id="ud32cee4a" id="ud32cee4a"><span data-lake-id="ud9465147" id="ud9465147">先进的 all-reduce 实现通常采用两阶段方法。第一阶段执行 reduce-scatter，将数据的不同部分归约到不同进程；第二阶段执行 all-gather，使每个进程收集所有进程上已经归约的数据。这两个阶段共同完成一次 all-reduce</span></li><li fid="u3f93eee3" data-lake-id="u15a85fc3" id="u15a85fc3"><span data-lake-id="u822157cb" id="u822157cb">reduce-scatter 和 all-gather 均采用流水线方式实现，对于包含 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb63b49ecb1da3499b85e2108a68d9ca5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rLcSb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u58baaadb" id="u58baaadb"> 个元素的数据，两者各自需要传输总计 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb63b49ecb1da3499b85e2108a68d9ca5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OQLzQ%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8411783c" id="u8411783c"> 个元素。因此，标准 DP 在每个训练步骤中的数据传输量为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6a5d6594e9be2bda82fb9bf1049e6dc2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22o4p72%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42e1e700" id="u42e1e700">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u21d33080" id="u21d33080"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b3019db" id="u6b3019db" style="color: #663000">采用梯度分片后，每个进程仅存储更新其对应参数分区所需的那部分梯度。因此，ZeRO 只需要对梯度执行 scatter-reduce 操作，而无须执行 all-reduce，由此产生的通信量为 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb63b49ecb1da3499b85e2108a68d9ca5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oIGH5%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u55cc6acf" id="u55cc6acf" style="color: #663000">。当每个进程完成其负责的参数分区更新后，再执行一次 all-gather，收集所有数据并行进程中已经更新的参数。这同样产生 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb63b49ecb1da3499b85e2108a68d9ca5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OsbIo%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u85d5e65e" id="u85d5e65e" style="color: #663000"> 的通信量。因此，每个训练步骤的总通信量为 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5CPsi%2B%5C%5CPsi%3D2%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcff5b7bca32abcee51895140df6e35d3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eIxfU%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c8781c9" id="u9c8781c9" style="color: #663000">，与标准 DP 完全相同</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u1c7bc424" id="u1c7bc424"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue8c90f73" id="ue8c90f73">采用参数分片后，每个数据并行进程仅存储由自身负责更新的参数。因此，在前向传播过程中，它需要接收其他所有分区的参数。不过，这一过程可以采用流水线方式执行，以避免额外的内存开销</span></strong></p><ul list="u13fc0384"><li fid="u35a88559" data-lake-id="u4d4c0178" id="u4d4c0178"><span data-lake-id="uf0da1cbe" id="uf0da1cbe">在计算某个特定分区对应模型部分的前向传播之前，负责该分区的数据并行进程可以将权重广播到所有数据并行进程。该分区的前向传播完成后，便可以丢弃这些参数。因此，总通信量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5CPsi%5C%5Ctimes%20N_d%7D%7BN_d%7D%3D%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9bb262d8e53b155cb060ee2c01d17713.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C1pmC%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u35a88559" data-lake-id="u118b828c" id="u118b828c"><strong><span data-lake-id="uacdf2c5c" id="uacdf2c5c" style="color: #2A4200">重新调度参数的 all-gather，将其分散到整个前向传播过程中，并在参数使用完毕后将其丢弃。不过，在反向传播过程中，还需要以相反的顺序再次执行这一 all-gather。总通信量由这些 all-gather 产生的通信量，以及梯度 reduce-scatter 产生的通信量共同构成，总计为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%223%5C%5CPsi%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd2b821eb190cfe5ad86a311fdf4f4ff9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dSDBo%22%7D" style="color: #2A4200"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u65e2aeae" id="u65e2aeae" style="color: #2A4200">，即标准 DP 的 1.5 倍。梯度分片和参数分片都利用同一个核心洞见：并非所有梯度和参数状态在每个时刻都需要使用。因此，可以通过合理安排这些状态的通信来优化内存占用</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2434bb38" id="u2434bb38"><span data-lake-id="u57e1ec87" id="u57e1ec87">在采用激活检查点的 Megatron-LM 中，每个 Transformer 块在前向传播过程中执行两次大小为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22batch%5C%5Ctimes%20seq%5C%5C_length%5C%5Ctimes%20hidden%5C%5C_dim%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F47646646395e1c49076ea1aea705cb0b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ay3pj%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc8281f60" id="uc8281f60">的 all-reduce，在前向重计算过程中执行两次 all-reduce，并在反向传播过程中再执行两次 all-reduce。由于一次 all-reduce 的通信量为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222%5C%5Ctimes%20message%5C%5C_size%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67ebe76e9f8604ff699f4284ed34d2e7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aZ52Z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufef0db85" id="ufef0db85">，因此，每个 Transformer 块的总通信量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%2212%5C%5Ctimes%20seq%5C%5C_length%5C%5Ctimes%20hidden%5C%5C_dim%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0d7816456caef8714d9d079942db1880.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WmfEO%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udfaf7e43" id="udfaf7e43"><span data-lake-id="ua904c0e4" id="ua904c0e4">当 ZeRO-R 对激活检查点进行分片时，在反向传播阶段针对每个激活检查点执行前向重计算之前，需要额外执行一次 all-gather。通常，将每个 Transformer 块的输入激活值保存为检查点，因此，每个 Transformer 块需要执行一次 all-gather。由于一次 all-gather 的通信量为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22message%5C%5C_size%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3110f1bc1eb363823af7bc70e1b5814d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22C4bZI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue9ff4cfb" id="ue9ff4cfb">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38b0ebcc3cd17845a7fd86182b093d51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PFWYm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua6c11b51" id="ua6c11b51">引入的通信开销为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22seq%5C%5C_length*hidden%5C%5C_dim%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcbceddbd8d44ed122f596a012c62a012.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eUu1u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub1a762ae" id="ub1a762ae">。因此，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22P_a%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F38b0ebcc3cd17845a7fd86182b093d51.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d0rqS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7917dd2" id="ud7917dd2">额外引入的总通信量不到原始模型并行通信量的 10%</span></p>